<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
      color: white;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .content {
      background: #f9fafb;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 0 0 10px 10px;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #667eea;
      color: white;
      padding: 12px 30px;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 5px;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
    .text-preview {
      background: white;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      border-left: 4px solid #667eea;
      margin: 20px 0;
      font-style: italic;
    }
    .footer {
      text-align: center;
      color: #666;
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <h1>🎙️ Your Audio is Ready!</h1>
  </div>
  
  <div class="content">
    <p>Great news! Your text-to-speech conversion has been completed successfully.</p>
    
    <div class="text-preview">
      "<%= truncate(@voice_generation.text, length: 200) %>"
    </div>
    
    <p>Click the button below to listen to your audio:</p>
    
    <a href="<%= @audio_url %>" class="button">🎧 Listen Now</a>
    
    <p style="margin-top: 30px; font-size: 14px; color: #666;">
      Or copy this link: <br>
      <a href="<%= @audio_url %>"><%= @audio_url %></a>
    </p>
  </div>
  
  <div class="footer">
    <p>This email was sent because you requested a voice generation with email notification.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>

